\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A.1}{\ignorespaces Phase 2 offline CQL safety-value-function hyperparameters. The dataset is collected under \texttt {noisy} perception because a runtime filter must learn the conditions it faces at deployment (Section~\ref {sec:setup:perception-mode}).}}{75}{table.caption.81}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A.2}{\ignorespaces Phase 3 headline hyperparameters (fixed-$\lambda $ constrained CQN-AS{}). The cost critic is fully decoupled (its own optimiser and its own features, the RoboBase shared-encoder constraint) and cold-started.}}{75}{table.caption.82}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A.3}{\ignorespaces Runtime deployment configurations per regime. The veto and the model-based dodges are taxonomy points, not deployment configurations.}}{76}{table.caption.83}%
